        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Phil Harris, Joey King, Sam Raimi, Joe Roth, David Lindsay-Abaire, Mitchell Kapner\n- Films: Robin Hood, Oz the Great and Powerful, The Jungle Book, The Aristocats, The Conjuring, White House Down\n- Companies: Walt Disney Productions\n\nFacts:\n- Phil Harris played Baloo the bear in The Jungle Book in 1967.\n- Phil Harris played Thomas O'Malley in The Aristocats in 1970.\n- Robin Hood is a 1973 American animated musical comedy-adventure film produced by Walt Disney Productions.\n- Robin Hood was first released in the United States on November 8, 1973.\n- Phil Harris played Little John in Robin Hood in 1973.\n- Oz the Great and Powerful is a 2013 American fantasy adventure film directed by Sam Raimi.\n- Oz the Great and Powerful was produced by Joe Roth and written by David Lindsay-Abaire and Mitchell Kapner.\n- Joey King appeared in Oz the Great and Powerful, The Conjuring, and White House Down.",
